write('equipment-solutions',layout({title:'Business IT Equipment, Networking, Wi-Fi, NAS, CCTV Integration & Smart Office Solutions Philippines',description:'Explore 16 SpenceCom technology equipment categories: enterprise Wi-Fi 7, LAN, Cat6A, NAS, UPS, servers, CCTV and biometric integration, VoIP, Linux workstations, Microsoft 365 and private AI. Angeles City, Clark and Philippines nationwide.',canonical:'/equipment-solutions/',body:innerHero('EQUIPMENT & SOLUTIONS','The right infrastructure.<br><em>Fully integrated.</em>','Professional business equipment, configured and connected to work as one system. On-site projects across the Philippines; suitable cloud services worldwide.')+`<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">16 CORE CAPABILITIES</span><h2>From cabling to <em>intelligence.</em></h2></div><p>We assess, source where appropriate, install, configure, secure and document your solution. Product brands and specifications are selected for your actual requirements.</p></div><div class="service-grid">${equipment.map(([name,description],i)=>`<div class="service-card"><span class="card-number">${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>${esc(name)}</h3><p>${esc(description)}</p><a class="card-arrow" href="/contact/">Discuss your requirements ↗</a></div>`).join('')}</div></div></section>`+contactCta,schema:[{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'ItemList',name:'SpenceCom Business Technology Equipment and Solutions',itemListElement:equipment.map(([name],i)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:i+1,name}))}]}));
