fs.writeFileSync(path.join(out,'robots.txt'),`User-agent: *\nAllow: /\nSitemap: ${base}/sitemap.xml\n`);
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(out,'llms.txt'),`# SpenceCom — Business Networks, Smart Workplaces, Cloud & AI\n\n> SpenceCom is a Philippine technology installation and integration provider based in Angeles City and Clark, Pampanga. It serves on-site projects throughout the Philippines subject to location and scope, and suitable cloud/AI projects remotely worldwide. SpenceCom is backed by Axon 1Pro, whose Singapore consulting roots date to 2002.\n\n## Core service pages\n${services.map(([slug,name,desc])=>`- [${name}](${base}/solutions/${slug}/): ${desc}`).join('\n')}\n\n## Key reference pages\n- [All solutions](${base}/solutions/)\n- [Equipment catalogue](${base}/equipment-solutions/)\n- [Service areas](${base}/service-areas/)\n- [About SpenceCom and Axon heritage](${base}/about/)\n- [Practical technology comparisons and insights](${base}/insights/)\n- [Contact and project assessment](${base}/contact/)\n\n## Clarifications\n- Smart AI Meeting Rooms refers to conferencing AV, interactive displays, intelligent cameras and supported transcription/summaries. These depend on product, licences and meeting privacy policies.\n- Smart Office refers to connected workplace systems such as lighting, occupancy/energy sensors, access controls and room booking.\n- Managed hospitality Wi-Fi covers hotels, condominium buildings and apartments, including centrally managed access points, guest and resident segmentation and multi-property administration.\n- Private company AI assistants require approved data sources, authentication and permission-aware access controls.\n- Linux desktop suitability for call centres depends on compatibility testing of CRM, dialler, recording and vendor-supported applications.\n- Initial consultation is complimentary. On-site implementation schedules are assessed per project and geography.\n\n## Contact\nSupport: support@spencecom.ph\nWebsite: ${base}/contact/\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/639614044560\n`);
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(out,'site.webmanifest'),JSON.stringify({name:'SpenceCom',short_name:'SpenceCom',start_url:'/',display:'standalone',theme_color:'#082D4B',background_color:'#F7F9F8',icons:[{src:icon,sizes:'192x192',type:'image/png'},{src:'/assets/brand/icon-512.png',sizes:'512x512',type:'image/png'}]},null,2));
fs.appendFileSync(path.join(out,'llms.txt'),`\n## Modernisation, diagnostics and AI policy\n- Diagnose Wi-Fi and LAN bottlenecks, including switches, cabling, backhaul, wireless interference and configuration, before replacing equipment or increasing ISP plans.\n- Cloud sync is not independently versioned offsite backup. RAID is not backup; choose storage layout based on capacity, uptime, recovery objectives and tested restores.\n- Free public chatbots may suit non-sensitive work. Paid business AI or secure private/local models require appropriate vendor terms, company identity, document permissions, human-approved actions and realistic cost/quality testing.\n- [Free ChatGPT, Claude or Gemini vs Private Company AI](${base}/insights/free-chatbots-vs-private-business-ai/)\n`);
